title: MikroTik REST API: License (CHR)
agents: mikrotik_rest_api
catalog: hw/network/mikrotik
license: GPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 License expiry of a MikroTik Cloud Hosted Router (CHR), read from
 {/system/license} ({deadline-at}, {next-renewal-at}).

 The service is WARN 14 days and CRIT 3 days before the license expires,
 the time until the next renewal is shown in the details. Levels and the
 time pattern via the rule {MikroTik REST API: License (CHR)}.

 Special agent {MikroTik RouterOS (mikrotik-rest-api)} in Setup >
 Agents > Other integrations, module "License Key (CHR)".

perfdata:
 Time until the license expires.

inventory:
 One service if the device reports a license deadline.
